docs/evidence/real-machine/
docs/evidence/tui-frames/

# generated by scripts/stamp_build.py (CI only)
src/oaset/_build_info.py
oaset-session-*.md

# Agent-tool generated plans (not project docs; the plan source is docs/PLAN.zh-CN.md)
docs/superpowers/
debug.log
